{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "M02 resources / 教室座位与统一占用",
    "version": "2.0.0",
    "description": "Public reads require resource:rooms:read, writes require resource:rooms:write and existing Cookie CSRF. Internal APIs only accept X-Service-Key and never depend on a forwarded user Cookie. Times are [start,end), opening schedules use Asia/Shanghai (equal times mean all-day; overnight supported). Operation/source version duplicates are idempotent, altered payload conflicts, and stale messages cannot resurrect tombstones. Room-wide scopes cover seats subsequently created/enabled. Audit uses a persistent journal/outbox, sourceModule D, same eventKey M02:<operationId>, safe fixed projection. HTTP-born resources are known absent before birth; migrated pre-snapshot history remains incomplete. Statistics include M1+M2 deduplicated confirmed IDs with positive retained service intersection; existing bookings never reduce denominator."
  },
